(text "SN74AXC8T245 x16 (bom 1.2, VQFN RHL ruled 2026-10-10): FPGA LVCMOS18 data from J6 (DATnn_1V8 = cascode_l) and J5/J6 (DATRnn_1V8 = cascode_r) -> 3.3 V DATnn / DATRnn -> the 128 CELL sheets (LVC1G74 D). DIR1/DIR2 tied to VCCA (A->B), /OE to GND, PAD to GND. A side on V18 (SoM VCCIO, not generated here), B side on V33FF (ADP7158, power sheet). Layout (bom 1.2): place at the SoM connectors on the FPGA side; FPGA pin -> A input +-2.5 mm within a group and across all 16; B output -> LVC1G74 D per the cell-array rule." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "63a410b1-c818-4e74-8a2a-c3bf7aebcf4b"))
(text "L channel: DATnn_1V8 -> DATnn, U440..U447" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 28.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ebe19694-fd7b-41d4-939d-63c1fc54698e"))
